!/docs/PROJECT-GUIDE.md
!/docs/README.md
!/docs/session-reports/
!/docs/session-reports/*.md
!/docs/SETUP.md
!/docs/SMOKE.md
!/docs/STACK.md
!/docs/TESTING.md
!/docs/UX-TEST-PROTOCOL.md
